      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">May drop a single flare per turn, dropped as bombs and scattered.  Leave the marker in place until the end of the turn.  Any unit targeting an enemy unit within 12&quot; of the Flare gains the Night Vision rule for that shootingi phase.  Does not apply to Split Fire attacks on other units.</characteristic>
