          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">One use only. This Act of Faith can be used in either player&apos;s Assault phase. If successful, all models in the Canoness&apos; unit gain the Hatred special rule until the end of the current phase.</characteristic>
