      <rules>
        <rule name="Fire and Faith" id="4217-c5be-4653-bea4" hidden="false" page="115" publicationId="818a0a0f--pubN69117">
          <description>If this formation combines their shooting attacks (see Wall of Fire below) and even a single unit makes a successful Divine Guidance Act of Faith roll, the combined shooting attack&apos;s profile gains the Rending special rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Wall of Fire" id="a59a-8eb4-3133-b748" hidden="false" page="115" publicationId="818a0a0f--pubN69117">
          <description>Six or more units in the formation can combine their shooting attacks into a single attack using one of the profiles below. All of the firing units must have at least one model that is in range and has line of sight to the target.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
