                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">One use only. This Act of Faith can be used in the Shooting phase. If successful, all weapons in the Retributors unit gain the Rending special rule until the end of the current phase.</characteristic>
